            name: "create-origin-endpoint",
            description: Some("The endpoint is attached to a channel, and represents the output of the live content. You can associate multiple endpoints to a single channel. Each endpoint gives players and downstream CDNs (such as Amazon CloudFront) access to the content for playback. Content can't be served from a channel until it has an endpoint. You can create only one endpoint with each request"),
